 |\\n\\n### 主要出差/拜访情况：\\n\\n**高频活动城市及区域**：\\n- **深圳**：深圳湾超级总部基地C塔、华虹半导体二期、达实智能、金证科技、星火电子等客户\\n- **上海**：浦东国际机场、安保设备、中加集成等客户\\n- **西安/陕西**：咸阳机场、化工行业探索\\n- **成都**：华虹半导体、太原武宿机场等项目配合\\n- **广州**：宇洪科技、天玺壹号项目\\n- **南宁**：轨道科技创新产业园\\n\\n### 主要工作内容：\\n\\n1. **投标配合**：成都华虹二期、深圳湾C塔、南宁产业园、浦东机场等重点项目投标支持\\n2. **客户开拓**：新增合作伙伴开发（必维检验、中建西南院、中铁四局、深圳设计院等）\\n3. **现场协调**：康桥集成电路项目、太原武宿机场等在建项目现场对接\\n4. **产品方案推动**：与集成商、顾问、业主进行方案确认和品牌推广\\n\\n**工作密度**：月均工作日22天，日均工时6.2小时，属于高强度外勤工作。", "type": "text"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "在吗", "type": "text"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "在的，有什么需要帮助的吗？", "type": "text"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "帮我看下郭小会上个月的月度工作成绩特别和绩效相关的", "type": "text"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "让我查询郭小会上个月的月度绩效数据。", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01NcubmoZ7mA9fk6DctvJhz8", "name": "query_pma_database", "type": "tool_use", "input": {"sql": "SELECT \\n  u.real_name as 姓名,\\n  COUNT(DISTINCT a.id) as 行动记录数,\\n  COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN q.id IS NOT NULL THEN q.id END) as 报价单数,\\n  COALESCE(SUM(q.amount), 0) as 报价总额,\\n  COUNT(DISTINCT a.company_id) as 客户接触数,\\n  COUNT(DISTINCT a.project_id) as 项目接触数\\nFROM users u\\nLEFT JOIN actions a ON u.id = a.owner_id \\n  AND EXTRACT(YEAR FROM a.date) = 2026 \\n  AND EXTRACT(MONTH FROM a.date) = 3\\nLEFT JOIN quotations q ON u.id = q.owner_id \\n  AND EXTRACT(YEAR FROM q.id) = 2026 \\n  AND EXTRACT(MONTH FROM DATE(q.id)) = 3\\nWHERE u.real_name = '郭小会'\\nGROUP BY u.id, u.real_name"}}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "tool_result", "content": "{\\"error\\": \\"查询执行失败: (psycopg2.errors.UndefinedFunction) function pg_catalog.extract(unknown, integer) does not exist\\\\nLINE 13:   AND EXTRACT(YEAR FROM q.id) = 2026 \\\\n               ^\\\\nHINT:  No function matches the given name and argument types. You might need to add explicit type casts.\\\\n\\\\n[SQL: SELECT \\\\n  u.real_name as 姓名,\\\\n  COUNT(DISTINCT a.id) as 行动记录数,\\\\n  COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN q.id IS NOT NULL THEN q.i